The scatter plot shows the relationship between the two counts, with the fitted regression line.


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
plot(photocounts, fieldcounts, main="Field Counts vs Photo Counts")
abline(lmfit, col="purple", lwd=2)
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![Field counts vs. photo counts of dead trees with the fitted regression line](ratio_files/figure-html/fig-deadtrees-regression-fit-1.png){#fig-deadtrees-regression-fit width=672}
:::
